   "date": "2016-03-16",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Customs and Other Legislation Amendment Bill 2016 amends multiple acts to allow exemptions from import declaration processing charges for compliance with international agreements, permit screening authorities to open sealed duty-free bags for re-screening, and remove the requirement for Australian manufacturers to prove 25% factory costs for tariff concession orders, among other deregulatory and technical changes."
